{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 30,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you may have seen this thumbnail on YouTube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3200,
    "dDurationMs": 2143,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I can actually basically guarantee"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5343,
    "dDurationMs": 2457,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that YouTube has been shoving this in your face"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7800,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, \"Click! Click! Click it again!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10680,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you might be wondering why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12640,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why did this video in particular go viral?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16120,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that is what I'm gonna set out to explain in this video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19720,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm gonna start with something that seems unrelated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23960,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is YouTuber burnout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26120,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, there's no secret, there have been a lot of YouTubers recently talking about burnout:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30720,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people like Casey Neistat, Superwoman, Ryan Higa, Grace Helbig,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34740,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and many, many, MANY more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37760,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think, when you have all of these people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40840,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with different YouTube channels, different experiences, they're all saying something similar;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45400,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's worth understanding that there may be sort of a common factor at play amongst all of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51480,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I'm actually gonna present is a kind of theory of everything when it comes to YouTube;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57040,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything from YouTuber burnout, through to videos going viral;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61320,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why do videos go viral on the platform right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64600,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so, you know, I think as a viewer your response to burnout might be to say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69160,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Well these YouTubers are just entitled\" or, \"They're soft\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71960,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or, you know, \"Boohoo, you have the best job in the world\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75040,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or your other response might be that burnout happens in every industry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79200,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so why should we care about this YouTuber thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81120,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think that YouTuber burnout is a more specific phenomenon;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85280,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there's something particular going on here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88200,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it all starts with the YouTuber life cycle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92560,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you think about a YouTuber who's complaining about burnout,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95440,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know they've had some success on the platform"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98120,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where their views are rising - and of course that's exhilarating,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101080,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it feels great and you're working pretty hard, but you're seeing it pay off,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106360,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then at some point your views start to falter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110080,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so maybe you work a little bit harder but things don't really change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114200,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and-and the views, you know, continue to fall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117240,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there's a certain thing to do with the psychology of anchoring here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120840,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, once you have a certain number of subscribers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124000,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then, you know, a hundred thousand views which might be amazing in the beginning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127720,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "feels like a horrible disappointment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130080,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's a real problem between sort of expectations and reality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134600,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to me, this is a big part of why YouTuber burnout happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139280,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you look at what the YouTubers are saying about this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143040,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you find that a lot of them are taking responsibility themselves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147360,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're also making some clear cause-and-effect relationships,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151800,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which you know this kind of seemed to make sense:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156000,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "okay, so this idea we assume that views reflect something about video quality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161600,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we kind of make that assumption,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163520,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so when there are, you know, fewer views taking place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168120,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that means the video is lower quality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169960,
    "dDurationMs": 2612,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is just kind of, I think, instinctive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172572,
    "dDurationMs": 1828,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I want to question that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174400,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also want to question these YouTubers who essentially put the blame on themselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178120,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and say, you know, they're just not making as good videos anymore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to me I think there's something else at play,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185000,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is the system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187920,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, from time to time, I like to go over to Google Trends,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190920,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you can basically search any search term"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193320,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see how much traffic there is, how many people are searching that term at any given time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197720,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you search for \"Veritasium\" basically since 2004"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202200,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you see, well,  this kind of curve,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205200,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which might make you ask the question:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207520,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Where on the YouTuber life cycle do you think I am?\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211480,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and of course this little spike here is from my black hole videos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214280,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this over here must be some Harry Potter fans who are bad at spelling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218800,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is how much people are searching for me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220800,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I think kind of correlates to how much my videos are being shown on YouTube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225720,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how much people are watching them and enjoying them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227840,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's look at a similar channel for comparison. How about the channel Numberphile?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234080,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's also an educational channel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236040,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's, uh, you know, very diff- made by very different people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239720,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with very different schedules, very different topics that we've tackled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242360,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet these graphs look pretty similar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245200,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uhh, let me have a look at one more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is the AsapSCIENCE curve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251720,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here you have Veritasium, Numberphile, and AsapSCIENCE: three educational YouTube channels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257600,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which all follow a fairly similar pattern on Google Trends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263280,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my question is: You know, why is this? Why should we follow a similar trend?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268920,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the obvious answer is the algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272840,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the algorithm has a very important job,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275160,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because in traditional media, there are not that many works produced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279480,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, in American theaters last year, there were about 800 films."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284360,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "800 films. That's it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285600,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On TV there were 500 scripted TV shows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289400,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when it comes to YouTube, it doesn't even compare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293040,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I don't even think that they advertise the number of hundreds of hours uploaded every minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300120,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The obvious analogy is that you're really just seeing the tip of the iceberg,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304520,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in the case of icebergs, you see, you know, almost 10% of the ice above the surface."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308840,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the case of YouTube you're seeing just (the tip of)x5 of the iceberg"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314360,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "basically, statistically speaking, you are ignorant of everything on YouTube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319320,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yet, YouTube claims that they have this algorithm, which you can think of, like, the brain of the platform"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326760,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can connect an audience (that knows almost nothing of what's on the platform),"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331040,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the particular types of content they like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335040,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in the best case, they would argue, YouTube would argue, that the algorithm is basically the audience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342840,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, the audience decides what they want to watch and-and the algorithm is just reflecting that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347520,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but of course, we are not in this ideal world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350680,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the audience itself is always kind of shifting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354560,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and changing who they are and what they like to watch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358000,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so, the algorithm, you can think of as following the audience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361960,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the algorithm is-is chasing this audience around and trying to reach them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367280,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what YouTube doesn't much consider, is that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370520,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, the YouTube creators use their content to try to chase the algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377360,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these YouTubers who would love to be creating content about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380240,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, whatever they're most passionate about in whatever way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383040,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they also see what's popular on the site and they try to make content that will please the algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389000,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so there's a way in which the content is chasing the algorithm, the algorithm is chasing the audience,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393800,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if the content actually manages to catch up with the algorithm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397720,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get a-a kind of perverse situation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400800,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in which the algorithm is the content."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405680,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406180,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, what do I mean by that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407520,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a crazy thought experiment: if YouTube wanted more videos of snails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412040,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they could make that happen;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413160,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't actually have to go out and make any snail videos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415160,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if they just, you know, promoted videos with snail in the title,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418360,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tomorrow there's gonna be a whole bunch on the front page and trending and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creators be like, \"Oh snails are the new thing!\", and they're going to go make a bunch of videos about snails."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425160,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTube would love to believe that-that creators don't care about the algorithm - but they do!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429940,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like the core aspect of how creators decide what content to make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435400,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just as a more, uh, down-to-earth example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439920,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can show you a graph of the length of my videos from 2011, through to today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445400,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what you see is, at the beginning, uh, all of my videos averaged about 2 or 3 minutes in length,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451120,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but these days, I'm fast approaching an average length of video of 10 minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457040,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, YouTube never came to me and said, \"Derek, you have to make longer videos\";"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460760,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all they said was, well videos that are longer and get longer watch time will be promoted more on the site,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468000,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so, people like myself and, you know, all the other creators who wanted to be seen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472120,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we made longer videos. It's just, what we did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476000,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we know that the algorithm is always changing;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479280,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're always trying to optimize it make it work better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481760,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they also change what it's trying to optimize for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485560,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the beginning it was simple: just views,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487960,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they quickly figured out that, of course, like, a 20 minute view is worth a lot more than a 5 second view,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492440,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the actual metric should be watch time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495520,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this, uh, was advantageous to people like gamers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498400,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because people like to watch people play video games for long periods of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501640,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also reduced the latency of the algorithm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503680,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by which I mean it updates every 10 minutes instead of, say, every day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508000,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's beneficial for news content and things that are really time-sensitive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512040,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to me as a YouTuber what this means is it's impossible to be an expert on YouTube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518760,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look at what it takes to become an expert at anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522600,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "according to the Nobel prize-winning economist Daniel Kahneman,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525840,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need, of course, many, many hours of practice. Effortful, deliberate practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530560,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on YouTube I would argue we get that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533560,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You also need timely feedback,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536360,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, again, on YouTube we're given plenty of tools to be able to see how our videos are performing;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543000,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but, when it comes to a reliable environment -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546400,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is an environment in which the rules of the game aren't changing:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550560,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you can think of something like chess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552160,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's possible to be a chess expert,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554280,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because in the middle of a game of chess, the rules don't suddenly change on you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558840,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, on YouTube, that is not true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561600,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are not playing by the same rules the whole time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564220,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the algorithm is constantly changing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566720,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, that puts us in this position, where it's kind of impossible to be experts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571280,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and instead we're a little bit more like [page flips], caged pigeons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576080,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, go with me on this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577360,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, there was this famous experiment where, you know, pigeons were put in a cage with a lever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581880,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if they push the lever then they would get some food,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585320,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so they very quickly learned that they needed to push the lever and the food would come out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589640,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that's fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590960,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in a another part of the experiment they disconnected, the lever from the food output"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596600,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they just supplied food into the cage, kind of, at random"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601000,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what did the pigeons do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603280,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, they started to do the types of behaviors that they were doing when the food appeared,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607920,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so, if one was preening itself then it would keep preening itself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611840,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the expectation that food was coming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613440,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this one, maybe he was pecking the ground;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616360,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so, the point being they started to engage in these superstitious behaviors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620960,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "um, because they had related some sort of cause and effect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623760,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there actually wasn't a cause and effect there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626280,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to me, this partly explains the whole YouTube burnout phenomenon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630440,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you have these creators who are stretching themselves to try to chase that algorithm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634600,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meanwhile the algorithm is constantly shifting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636720,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so you never feel like an expert and never quite know what's going on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639840,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though you're constantly trying to relate cause and effect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643040,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now I can understand why the algorithm has to change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645520,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean in the early days of YouTube, it was this situation where if you had subscribers you were golden"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651000,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the next time you uploaded some content"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653560,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then YouTube would show it to all your subscribers it'll get a ton of views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656680,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTube would say \"oh this is a popular video\", show it to even more people, getting you even more subscribers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661400,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the next time you launch another video then it goes to more subscribers more views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665880,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was just this positive feedback loop where you would grow and grow and grow a channel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669640,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the rich got richer and small channels stayed small"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673040,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so obviously we needed something to break the cycle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675640,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so YouTube started doing some experiments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678760,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they would essentially change what was recommended to your audience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684440,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they would stop showing some of the content from certain subscribers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688520,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they saw what happened to views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690920,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they started disconnecting these subscribers from the channel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695440,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No longer was a subscription like \"I want to see every video by this person\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699200,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was more of a suggestion that maybe something this person creates is something I might like to see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705880,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what YouTube found when they did that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708200,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was that the number of views on the platform the amount of watch time all rose dramatically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714040,
    "dDurationMs": 7400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so for YouTube to get growth of the site they found that reducing the importance of subscriptions was essential"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721440,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this kind of makes sense if you think about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723160,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean if you make one great video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725200,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that doesn't necessarily mean that every video you're gonna make is gonna be great"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728880,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it makes sense for YouTube to step in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730760,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and play some role in terms of determining what gets shown to which audience members"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736200,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, as has been observed by MatPat previously,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740320,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moving away from subscriptions moves YouTube back to what it was like to sell newspapers on the street"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747040,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you really had to inspire people to buy on the spot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750400,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to serve up really sensational news items. This is also called yellow journalism."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755160,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was only once the newspapers built subscription models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758520,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that newspapers could make sober journalism a reality, something that they focused on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764880,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they already had your eyeballs, they didn't have to fight for that sort of attention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768920,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they didn't have to be as sensational"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771120,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but YouTube is going in the opposite direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774680,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reducing the importance of subscribers means increasing the importance of sensationalism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780240,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and click-baity thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782400,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so a few weeks ago I was out at the creator summit in New York"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786680,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I met MrBeast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788240,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I showed him some of the footage from this video I was working on about the shade balls in LA Reservoir"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793200,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and MrBeast took one look at it, and he said to me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799200,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's a banger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801240,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I think it's pretty funny but I think clearly he knew that this was going to be a video that would take off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806360,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we talked about titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808880,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might have noticed that the thumbnail borrows a bit from say his work with cereal and Orbeez in backyards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815600,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I told him that I was thinking about calling it something like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819160,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Throwing Shade Balls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821800,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he was like, \"No\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824160,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He suggested, why are there 96 million black balls on this lake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829600,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I changed it to reservoir because I mean let's be real that's what it is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834360,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it just goes to show how important the title and thumbnail are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838320,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what I learned talking to MrBeast was that going viral you can boil down to two metrics:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845120,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to do two things with your video in order for it to go viral"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848360,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I mean tens of millions of views as his channel shows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851720,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay the first thing, maybe not surprising, is watch time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855360,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so when people click on your video they actually have to watch a significant portion of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859880,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's useful if that's sort of seven or eight minutes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862360,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now that is the actual time that they watch, so you need a longer video than that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866080,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say 15 minutes, if you want the average watch time to be around that 7 or 8 minute mark"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871040,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now for me, watch time is not that exciting of a metric to know that I have to hit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875760,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I know that most people already watch most of my videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879800,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so for me the big insight came with number two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882480,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you want a viral video you need to have a high click-through rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886560,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that is the total number of clicks on your titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890560,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "divided by the number of times that title and thumbnail have been shown"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894960,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is your click-through rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896360,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and MrBeast showed me this graph showing that as you approach 10% 20% 30% click-through rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903440,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the number of views and the number of impressions that video will get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907080,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just skyrockets. It jumps dramatically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910640,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now on the one hand that kind of makes sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you know people are clicking a video obviously you're going to get more views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916600,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it is such a dramatic increase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919760,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it really turns the site into a place where the title and thumbnail are everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926200,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can have a great video but unless you have a great hook to get people in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930520,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not going to go viral"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932400,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so it was amazing to hear all these different YouTubers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935480,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "talk about how they optimized a thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937720,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "many people told me that when they were working on a thumbnail for a new video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941040,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would actually Photoshop it onto a screenshot of their current YouTube home screen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946880,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in various positions and just see how eye catching it was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950440,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're really working hard to make these thumbnails as clickable as possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956200,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's like weaponizing the thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958320,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that arms race is only set to increase with the introduction of real-time click-through rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964040,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is coming out in a month or two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966440,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so what you can bet will happen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968120,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that creators will launch a video and then they'll be sitting there with all these different variants of thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973400,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they'll be swapping them out and looking at what that does to click-through rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977720,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then going with the one that leads to the greatest click-through rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982560,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can imagine, if you don't do this, you're gonna be left behind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986360,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because all the other creators are sitting there swapping their thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990520,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get the highest engagement that they possibly can on their videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994080,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you're not doing that, then your videos will end up getting buried"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998960,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, acknowledging that this is the reality of YouTube"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003440,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to outline to you my plan for what I will do going forward"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007560,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First and foremost, I want to keep making high-quality videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010960,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because if I don't do that I'm not going to be happy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013480,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I won't be satisfied and neither will you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015720,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but second of all I'm gonna have to choose topics that are more clickable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021000,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because frankly if I'm going to work for days and weeks and months on a video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026880,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would like that video to get say 10 million views instead of half a million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032240,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so a lot of that comes down to \"is this topic clickable\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036600,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so or number three I'm gonna have to use some clickbaity titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041960,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I apologize for that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044560,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it just seems like it's an existential threat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047360,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that if you don't do that your channel will not be around for very long"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050520,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll be on that sort of downward slide"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053320,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd love to know what you think, If you think it's a good idea a bad idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056200,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm totally open to hearing you out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058400,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "CaseyNeistat talked about how he's got to trust his audience, you know to come back to him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062880,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the truth is, the audience only knows you're there if they see your titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067280,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to buy something at B\u0026H a little while ago, and the guy was like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070720,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"oh hey I love your videos!\" and then he said, \"are you still making them?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075320,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was like, \"yeah yeah I'm making them. How do you not know?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078560,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I also see comments on my videos where people are like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080760,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"oh great here's a veritasium video see you again in six months\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083760,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm like, \"no I'm making these every week, every other week,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086920,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like I'm making them you just got to know that they're here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089480,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you can only know that they're there if they surface"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091600,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the tip of the tip of the tip of the tip of the iceberg"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094360,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which now is a click-through rate game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100080,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the one hand, you could be a little bit disappointed by the way the game is working right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105480,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but on the other hand I challenge you to think of a better way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109200,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they have this limited real estate in which to show people potential videos they might be interested in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116240,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and of course they want to put the videos there that people are most likely to click"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1121160,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then most likely to watch once they've clicked it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123760,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like part of me is like, yeah I guess that's kind of fair"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127120,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would you make the argument that you should put some videos there that people are less likely to click?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132760,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. I mean, that doesn't seem to make any sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137600,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I kind of feel like this is the inevitable, rational endpoint"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142920,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for any algorithm that is trying to optimize what people are watching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147040,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we want to give you the things that you want to watch and you indicate your desire by clicking on them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153760,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but by doing that it also means that things that are just less catchy, less sensational"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159880,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't rise into this level here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164160,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I wonder more broadly, how does that affect us?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169760,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does that affect the YouTube platform?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172160,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the YouTube platform becomes a real clickbait site"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176560,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who wants to go there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178040,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What types of audience will come there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180000,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will there even be an audience for educational content?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184040,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's all these decisions about the system and the algorithm that determine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188080,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what the actual media looks like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191440,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what content is created"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193440,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what people come to the site"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195000,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what audiences are served there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196960,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think this is a broader issue than just YouTube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200080,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, everywhere now we can be served the things that we you really want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1205880,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but what does that world look like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207440,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean you might have thought it would be this utopia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211040,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I would argue that it's not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213920,
    "dDurationMs": 8200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it silences all these voices that you would otherwise get you know in a more curated marketplace"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222120,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you're just going for the things that drive the clicks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226040,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a very skewed view on the world and I'm not sure it's for the best"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231360,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is one way on YouTube at least to short-circuit this effect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238280,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is to ring that bell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243720,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you're like, \"oh the whole point of this video is to get to this point and tell you to ring the bell!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247680,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, no, if you want to ring the bell, I encourage you to do that now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253520,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I feel like I never encouraged people to subscribe or ring the bell on this channel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258520,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it seems needy and I think you can do whatever you want, whenever you want it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264520,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in this ecosystem where click-through rate is king,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268280,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where millions of black balls on a reservoir is the thing that is going to rise to the surface,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273880,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the only way to get around that is to have people who are notified every time I make something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280240,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I want you to think about the videos that I've made you know in the past and so far this year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285040,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and think about do you want to know about every single one of those?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288920,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you do then I encourage you to click the bell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291720,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the more people who do that, the less I will be driven to make clickbaity titles and thumbnails and videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298840,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I'll know that I can reach my audience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300880,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without having to appeal to, you know, the basest instincts of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306560,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, if you want to see more of what I'm doing, click to subscribe, ring the bell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311240,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you don't then please you know unsubscribe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1313640,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it's good to give YouTube as clear of signals as possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318480,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think there is a bit of hope for the future"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320520,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because what I've described is the way YouTube appears to be working right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324720,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think that, well we know that the algorithm is always shifting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329120,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what I've heard is that the direction YouTube wants to go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333280,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is optimizing for long term, satisfied, watch time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339120,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's got three pieces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340680,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to look at, are people coming back time after time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343640,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they watch someone's videos do they come back time after time for months"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347040,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would be one signal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1348550,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are they watching for a long period of time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350800,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's also a sign that people are enjoying it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352640,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally, there's the satisfied piece."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355040,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are people satisfied by the things that they've seen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358480,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a new metric to add in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360720,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how do you really gauge satisfaction?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364040,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, YouTube is experimenting with surveys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368400,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Surveys just like this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1370960,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they will hopefully allow us to come to a different place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377640,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the algorithm isn't just about click-through rate and watch time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380720,
    "dDurationMs": 1924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's also about satisfaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382644,
    "dDurationMs": 2098,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much you're driven to come back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384742,
    "dDurationMs": 2218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much you really love the content."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386960,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my great hope is if we move in this direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389480,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there may be a time in the future where click-through rate is no longer king"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394080,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd love to know what you think so let me know down in the comments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396560,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm gonna jump straight into end screen here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398640,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to post a few thumbnails for videos that are not particularly a click-baity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1404200,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so feel free to click these. I mean you're gonna look at them and be like, \"I don't want to click that\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407280,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's exactly the point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408680,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these are apparently good videos that maybe just aren't as catchy in terms of titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413840,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to subscribe you can click up here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416680,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and thanks for listening to the rant that I've given many times to whoever will listen"
    } ]
  } ]
}
